---
title: "remove (Sui Framework: dynamic_field)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_addr: object_addr = object.to_address()
    q_get_addr --> q_hash: hash = hash_type_and_key(object_addr, name)
    q_hash --> q_remove_child: remove_child_object(object_addr, hash)
    q_remove_child --> q_destruct: Field(id, name, value) destructured
    q_destruct --> q_delete: id.delete()
    q_delete --> [*]: return value

    note right of q_remove_child
        INV-001: aborts EFieldDoesNotExist if field missing
        INV-002: aborts EFieldTypeMismatch if value type wrong
        INV-003: Field object is destroyed after value extraction
    end note
